**3. Tidy the *messy_survey.csv* file.**

```{r}

# Importing messy data.

messy_survey <- read.csv(here("data", "messy_survey.csv"))

# Tidying data.

tidy_survey <- messy_survey %>%
  separate_rows(Responses, sep = ";") %>%
  rename(Response = Responses)

# Exporting data.

write_csv(tidy_survey, here("data", "tidy_survey.csv"))

# Displaying data.

